# Local typed guidance, conversational UI, and local-understanding configuration without downloads.
Output assets/readme/ask.gif

Hide
Type "cd ~/Projects/demo && clear && nmsh"
Enter
Sleep 5s
Show

Type "/btw what can you do"
Enter
Sleep 4s
Escape
Type "/btw how do sessions work"
Enter
Sleep 4s
Escape
Type "/llm"
Enter
Sleep 3s
Escape
Type "/layout"
Enter
Sleep 2s
Escape
